      "text": "Abraham planted a grove in Beer-sheba, Gen. 21:33. ye shall … cut down their groves, Ex. 34:13 (Deut. 7:5). shalt not plant thee a grove of any trees, Deut. 16:21. they have made their groves, 1 Kgs. 14:15. Ahab made a grove, 1 Kgs. 16:33. made a grove, and worshipped all the host, 2 Kgs. 17:16. neither shall respect … the groves, or the images, Isa. 17:8. their children remember … their groves, Jer. 17:2. I will pluck up thy groves, Micah 5:14 (3 Ne. 21:18).",
